#: ../../source/reference/menu.rst:13
msgid ""
"The Menu class represents a graphical user interface (GUI) menu that "
"contains a list of options or actions that users can select. It provides "
"a way to organize and display commands or choices in a structured manner,"
" typically within a dropdown or context menu format. Menus are essential "
"in GUI design for providing users with accessible options and actions "
"within an application."
msgstr ""

